# Reference only. The optional colleague-owned container reads this file, not
# deploy/production/app.env. Never copy the GEO web/worker environment here.
#
# Create content-engine.env with mode 0600 and add only variables required by
# the colleague image (for example its model/provider credential and the
# verifier for the bearer token sent by GEO). Variable names on this side are
# owned by that image and therefore are intentionally not invented here.
#
# Production contract:
# - listen on 0.0.0.0:8080 inside the Compose network;
# - POST /api/v1/generate;
# - GET /health/live and GET /health/ready;
# - accept the token matching COLLEAGUE_CONTENT_ENGINE_TOKEN from app.env;
# - write temporary data only under /tmp;
# - require no GEO database, cookie, media, host-port, or Docker-socket access.
